<title>POLAND: Polish broad money rises 2.4 pct in May - NBP.</title>
<headline>Polish broad money rises 2.4 pct in May - NBP.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's broad money rose by 3.47 billion zlotys, or 2.4 percent, in May to 148.3 billion after a 2.3 percent rise in April, preliminary central bank figures showed.</p>
<p>Broad money supply grew 9.2 percent in the January-May period against 10.5 percent in the same period of last year.</p>
